MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Fire TV Sticks fit my interest in watching things on my television. Adding streaming would be useful, even though my 720p TV would not benefit from 4K.",
    "The Fire HD tablets felt relevant because I already use a Fire 7. I would consider the HD 10 for a substantially larger screen, with a compatible case."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo devices and smart plug assume I want voice control, but I have no current use for it. My power strips meet practical outlet needs rather than a desire to automate my home.",
    "The Blink bundle does not follow from my photography accessories. Tripods, memory cards, and a lens cap support taking pictures; they do not indicate that I want home surveillance."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Owning a Fire tablet seems to have been taken as interest in a broad range of Amazon devices, although only some serve purposes I currently care about.",
    "Broad connections such as cameras or power seem to matter too much compared with what I actually use the equipment for."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "I repeatedly buy accessories with specific practical uses, so compatibility with equipment I already own matters to me.",
    "Similar options are alternatives for me: I would choose one streaming stick and favor the HD 10 over the HD 8 for its larger screen. The themed remote cover adds no appeal."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my tablet and television interests but stretched them into an unsupported interest in voice assistants and home automation."
}
